  "body": "This is mainly a bug fix release that allows the TUI to use editors such as `vim` and `emacs -nw`. See https://github.com/dandavison/gitu/pull/7. It also contains improvements to submodule display.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Show TUI setup in the README by @dandavison in https://github.com/dandavison/delta/pull/2335\r\n* Indicate submodule dirty state by @Tegrask in https://github.com/dandavison/delta/pull/2349\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @Tegrask made their first contribution in https://github.com/dandavison/delta/pull/2349\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/dandavison/delta/compare/0.21.1...0.21.2",
